Rule 12 (floating-point parameters a and b of the beta distribution must be strictly positive)
{v_1 : float, v_2 : float} |= v_1 > 0 ∧ v_2 > 0
>>
Rule 13 (integer parameters a and b of the beta distribution must be strictly positive)
{v_1 : int, v_2 : int} |= v_1 > 0 ∧ v_2 > 0
>>
Rule 14 (tensors a and b must have non-complex, real-valued data types)
{v_1 : tensor, v_2 : tensor} |= dtype_(v_1) < 9 ∧ dtype_(v_2) < 9
