Rule 16 (shapes of same-rank tensors a and b must be broadcast-compatible)
{v_1 : tensor, v_2 : tensor} |= if ndim(v_1) = ndim(v_2) then ∀i ∈ [0, ndim(v_1) - 1] : (shape(v_1, i) - shape(v_2, i)) * (shape(v_1, i) - 1) * (shape(v_2, i) - 1) = 0
